<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - Baotrans - 130,000 tonnes coal western Australia/Beilun 15-30/11 $3.80 fio scale load/30,000 shinc Bao Island.</p>
<p>Doceape - 140,000 tonnes ore Sepetiba/Ijmuiden 20-30/11 $5.20 fio seven days shinc Hoogovens.</p>
<p>Folegandros - 90,000 tonnes Tuburao/Misurata mid Nov approx. $5.40 fio scale load/14,000 shinc Medmar.</p>
</text>
